# Build context allowlist. The image is built from the repo root
# (docker/deploy-*.sh runs `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .`) and the Dockerfile
# COPYs exactly three things: renv.lock, docker/arwen/arwen1.2.3.c and
# docker/MitoPilot_*.tar.gz.
#
# Deliberately an allowlist rather than a copy of .gitignore: .gitignore excludes
# /docker/MitoPilot*, and reusing it here would drop the package tarball the
# build installs.
*
!renv.lock
!docker/
# Stray 27 MB tracked blob in docker/ that nothing COPYs; re-excluded here so the
# allowlist above does not drag it into the context.
docker/docker
